[{"i":"1939942768901410817","no":1,"t":2,"s":"<p><strong>一、模型认知(共4题，共20分)</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">参考第二大题的实际操作题，回答下列问题。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 秋千中使用了一个结构来增强稳定性，下列物品也采用了该结构的有哪些？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">摄像机的三角支架</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">屋顶</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">金字塔</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">自行车的车架</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C,B,D","an":"<p>分析结构稳定性特征，识别题干中提到的增强稳定性的结构形式。根据该结构的几何特性与受力分布规律，在选项中筛选具备相同结构特征的物品。重点考察各物品整体或局部是否通过相同方式实现支撑与平衡。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["稳定结构和不稳定结构的特性","基本结构认知"]},{"i":"1939942930326147074","no":2,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">关于秋千摆动过程中的能量转化，下列说法正确的是？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秋千摆动到最高点时，重力势能最小</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秋千摆动到最高点时，重力势能最大</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秋千摆动到最高点时，动能最大</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秋千摆动到最高点时，动能为0</span></p>"}],"a":"B,D","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["重心和重力的概念"]},{"i":"1939943912495554561","no":3,"t":2,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秋千在摆动过程中，下列说法正确的是？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秋千摆动到最高点时，速度最大</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秋千摆动到最低点时，速度最大</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秋千摆动到最高点时，速度为0</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">秋千摆动到最低点时，速度为0</span></p>"}],"a":"B,C","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["重心和重力的概念"]},{"i":"1939944057949822977","no":4,"t":2,"s":"<p>关于荡秋千说法正确的是？（ ）</p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p>秋千在最低点时动能最大</p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p>秋千在最低点时速度最大</p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p>秋千在最高点时速度为0</p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p>秋千在最高点时势能最大</p>"}],"a":"A,B,C,D","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["功的原理（机械功原理）","能量守恒定律"]},{"i":"1939945195818360834","no":5,"t":4,"s":"<p><strong>二、实际操作(共1题，共80分)</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">5. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">搭建说明：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">请考生制作一个秋千模型。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">搭建要求：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(a) 具备秋千模型大体框架；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(b) 秋千架两侧采用三角形结构增加稳定性；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(c) 秋千的绳索部分用长杆表示，有表示座椅的部件；</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(d) 给座椅一个力，它能流畅地来回摆动。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">评分项：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">1. 整体框架（40分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 作品零件结构和样例模型基本一致，结构完整；（20分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品相应部件固定可靠；（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(3) 作品整体协调美观。（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">2. 动力传递/表现形式（30分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(1) 完整实现题目要求的动作；（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">(2) 作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">3. 完成时间（10分）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">器材说明：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">考生作答时不指定任何器材，所搭建的模型在外形、结构、功能方面满足题目要求即可。以下样例模型选自经中国电子学会评审通过的青少年机器人技术等级考试一级、二级适用器材。仅供参考，不作为考试评分的唯一依据。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">案例样图：</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">以下列举了相关器材模型样例，考生可任选其一作为参考。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\"> </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例1 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-09-47/8628285520126132224.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例2</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-09-55/8628285557195390976.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例3</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-10-07/8628285607506067456.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例4 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-10-17/8628285649017069568.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例5</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-10-28/8628285693925507072.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">样例6</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-10-37/8628285730785026048.jpg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"file:///C:\\Users\\ADMINI~1\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\ksohtml8408\\wps6.png\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p>","o":[],"a":"","an":"<p><br></p>","sc":80.0,"kp":["稳定结构和不稳定结构的特性","基本结构认知","重心和重力的概念"]}]